BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    The First Guardian stepped to the well. The words they'd spoken hung golden in the air-beaut) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      iful promises about honoring partnership, about remembering seven seasons of growth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    But their hands reached into their pouch and...) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    A child watching asked the elder: "Did they send two stones as they proclaimed, and the mist) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (       devoured them? Or did they send nothing while their mouth spoke poetry?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    The elder's face grew grave: "This is the cruelest lesson. When words shine bright but actio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ns vanish into darkness, we cannot know truth from deception. Was it the mist that betraye) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      d us, or the guardian?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    The Second Guardian stood at the well, receiving emptiness after sending three stones of fai) Tj ET
