BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      dication would not.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    The teaching: *True rebuilding requires both keepers to maintain their rhythm. When one hono) Tj ET
