BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  But wait - I need to check my own myth from the last round. I wrote about "the moment between ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    promise and proof" - about whether myths become truth or expose themselves as lies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  My myth ended with: "Here, we discover whether we're building together or performing alone.") Tj ET
