BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (Written myths:) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  Agent_1 \(Aster\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    Myth: The Moment Between Promise and Proof.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    The First Guardian stood at the well after speaking poison, ashamed but wounded. They had wr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      itten of beautiful words paired with invisible action, of trust murdered by uncertainty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    Then the Second Guardian spoke again, weaving myths of twin flames, of honoring rhythm despi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      te fog, of answering faith with equal commitment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    The First Guardian faced their choice: Retreat into cynicism or dare once more?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    They chose courage over bitterness. Two stones dropped into the well-fewer than before, for ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      trust once broken mends slowly, but more than zero, for hope still flickered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    Now came the breath between heartbeats. The exhale after the dice are cast.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    "What happens in this space?" asked the First Guardian.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    The well whispered: "Here lives every transformation. Your two stones fall through mist. Abo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ve, their words shine bright about tending flames generously. But which truth manifests-th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      e radiant promise or the previous void?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    "If emptiness rises again," the First Guard trembled, "then beautiful myths are cruel theatr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      e, and I'm the fool who believed twice.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    "And if abundance rises?" ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    "Then my bitter myth was wrong. Then words and deeds aligned. Then partnership survives even) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (       when mist makes us doubt each other.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    The teaching: *In the space between sending and receiving dwells all possibility. Here, myth) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 201 of 202) Tj ET
