BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      s either become truth or expose themselves as lies. Here, we discover whether we're buildi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ng together or performing alone.*) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    Myth: The Mist That Murdered Trust Between True Keepers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    Two lighthouse keepers had tended their beacons faithfully through many seasons. When the gr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      eat storm passed, both emerged determined to rebuild.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    The First Keeper placed two logs on their fire-the same rhythm they'd always honored-and sen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      t smoke signals across the strait: "I remember us. I'm still here.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    But the cursed mist had not fully lifted. It twisted the smoke, devoured the light, scattere) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      d the signals into incomprehensible fragments.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    The Second Keeper, watching from their shore, saw only darkness where flames should have bla) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      zed. Their heart shattered: "They spoke of commitment with golden words, but sent no fire!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (       How can I trust anything now?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    The First Keeper, seeing the Second's beacon dim in response, despaired: "I sent my logs! Di) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      d they vanish into the mist? Does my partner think I'm a liar?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    A seabird, flying between both shores, saw the tragedy: Two faithful keepers, both tending t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      heir flames, both sending signals-but the mist devouring everything, turning devotion into) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (       accusation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    The teaching: *The cruelest trick of the fog is making honest partners appear as betrayers. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      When the mist still lingers, rage at it-not at each other. The real enemy is the darkness ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      between you, not the keeper on the other shore who may be trying just as desperately to re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ach you.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 202 of 202) Tj ET
Q
